AI tooling
  Parts of the implementation and documentation were written with AI
  assistance under the maintainer's direction. The project draws on an array
  of models. These include Claude (Anthropic) and open-weight models such as
  Qwen and gpt-oss, served locally through Ollama. A delegate decides which
  model handles each task.
